WEBVTT

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Are you alright?

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Who are you? Why are you here?

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Are you planning to use oil to fry squid?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.000
We are just studying how to use a light bulb to make a living

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Don't listen to his lies. He's trying to blow us up.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Get rid of him and destroy all his oil.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Still lying? No one knows how to use oil better than me.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.000
But we can't just not discuss it.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
You actually attacked me? You...
